# Striking a Balance's edges: a level 75 Warrior in Al Zahbi, the quest accepted at Prog 3 (GMs). The blank: Prog 4,
# moved, the package; Prog 3 again (a GM; the package dropped by a GM): the blank at a row of positionTable: that row is
# its current one: another row drawn; the package again. Whitegate at Prog 4: 695, finished: Prog 5; out to Al Zahbi and
# back: Whitegate's zone-in at Prog 5: none. Past the last step (a GM, Prog 6): Saliyahf: nothing. Prog 5 again (a GM),
# a full bag: Saliyahf 696, finished: the bronze pieces do not fit: not completed; freed: 696: completed.
lists AlZahbi/blank_striking_a_balance/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onZoneIn/1 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/696
char zone=AlZahbi pos=-41.1,0,8.942 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.StrikingABalance accepted
charvar Quest[6][63]Prog 3
login
trigger blank_striking_a_balance        # Prog 3: Prog 4; moved (a row of 2-7); the package
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[6][63]Prog 3              # a GM
delkeyitem MunahdasPackage              # a GM
trigger blank_striking_a_balance        # at its row: Prog 4; moved to another row; the package
finish-if-event
warp -58.4,0,64.855 AhtUrhganWhitegate open   # Prog 4: 695
finish                                  # the package taken; Prog 5
warp -41.1,0,8.942 AlZahbi
warp -58.4,0,64.855 AhtUrhganWhitegate   # Prog 5: no zone-in event
charvar Quest[6][63]Prog 6              # a GM: past the last step
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 6: no section
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[6][63]Prog 5              # a GM
fill-inventory
trigger Saliyahf                        # Prog 5: 696
finish                                  # the bronze pieces do not fit: not completed
free-inventory
trigger Saliyahf                        # 696
finish                                  # completed
